<title>THAILAND: Saha Pathanapibul 1996 net rises 15.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Saha Pathanapibul 1996 net rises 15.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 8.11     vs	   7.00</p>
<p>    Net			223.82     vs	 193.13</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Saha Pathanapibul Plc, an industrial and consumer products company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
